# fourthpin design tokens

Canonical source: `style.css` `:root`.

## Colors
- `--bg` #F2EDE4 — bone paper
- `--accent` #A83A0A — NASA rust (primary emphasis)
- `--accent-2` #2E6E6A — Hanoi teal (vocab / secondary)
- `--text` #1C1A17 — body
- `--text-muted` #6B6460 — metadata (≥4.5:1 on bg)
- `--border` #C9C3B8

## Typography
- Serif body/display: `--font-serif` (IBM Plex Serif)
- UI/nav/meta: `--font-mono` (IBM Plex Mono)
- Sans: `--font-sans` (IBM Plex Sans)
- Scale: `--text-xs` through `--text-4xl` (fluid clamp on large sizes)

## Spacing
4pt grid: `--sp-1` (0.25rem) through `--sp-16` (4rem).

## Rules
- Grep `style.css` for existing patterns before adding classes
- No inline styles; no new CSS files
- HUD: one `.hud-stack` per page, fixed top-right
- Invoke `/design-critic` after significant visual changes
